nounced in  june ross lord global news windsor nova  scotia  and that is global national for this  saturday night i'm colleen christie  tonight's your canada is this patriotic  and illuminated astronaut sculpted out  of snow in winnipeg manitoba  some light on this last night of winter  thanks for watching hope you'll join us  again tomorrow have a good night  [Music]
 

